In support of his argument, he also relied upon following judgements:-
(i) Jasveer Singh and others vs. State of U.P. and others, (2017) 6 SCC 787;
(ii) Sawaran Lata and others vs. State of U.P. and others, (2010) 4 SCC 532;
(iii) Swaika Properties Pvt. Ltd. and others vs. State of Rajasthan and others, (2008)
4 SCC 695;
(iv) Municipal Corporation of Greater Bombay vs. The Industrial Development Investment Co. Pvt. Ltd. & others, (1996) 11 SCC 501;
(v) Hari Singh and others vs. State of U.P. and others, (1984) 2 SCC 624;
(vi) Sanjay Singh vs. State of U.P. and 3 others, Writ-C No. 1094 of 2017;
Smt. Saroj Sharma vs State Of U.P. And Others on 8 May, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/26117233/
2 (vii) Satendra Prasad and others vs. State of U.P. and others, JT 1993 (5) SC 385;
(viii) Banda Development Authority, Banda vs. Moti Lal Agarwal and others, (2011) 5 SCC 394,
(ix) Chandra Pal Singh and others vs. State of U.P. and others, 2014 (1) ADJ 163 (DB).
5.

